# Test recording control commands
# Validates RECORDSTART and RECORDSTOP

# Test 1: Start recording
RECORDSTART
WAIT 1s

# Test 2: Stop recording
RECORDSTOP
WAIT 500ms

# Test 3: Start and stop multiple times
RECORDSTART
WAIT 500ms
RECORDSTOP
WAIT 500ms

RECORDSTART
WAIT 500ms
RECORDSTOP
WAIT 500ms

# Test 4: Recording with effects
RECORDSTART
EFFECT Sharp Pixels
WAIT 500ms
EFFECT Soft CRT
WAIT 500ms
RECORDSTOP

STOP
